[0.072,"o","Made .moai/. The prefix is `lantern`\r\r\n  columns: todo → in_progress → review → done\r\r\n  put the merge rules into .gitattributes\r\r\n  put what moai writes (lock, tmp, worktrees) into .gitignore\r\r\n  planted the merge driver in .git/config — /tmp/mira/.local/bin/moai\r\r\n  brought the AGENTS.md block in line\r\r\n  wrote the moai guide to .moai/guide.md — the AGENTS.md block points at it\r\r\n  ran `moai skill install --scope local`:\r\r\n    Planted in /tmp/mira/lantern/.claude/moai-plugin\r\r\n      what the hooks call: moai hook <event>\r\r\n      · marketplace announced\r\r\n      · plugin registered\r\r\n    Reopen Claude and it is in. Sessions already open keep the old copy\r\r\n  ran `moai project add .`:\r\r\n    registered  /tmp/mira/lantern\r\r\n\r\r\nNext:  moai add 'first issue'\r\r\n"]
